--- !u!114 &2088461632
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2088461631}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 11 | Rastgelelik ve Prosed\xFCrel \xDCretim"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. GurultuArazi beti\u011Fi Arazi nesnesine
    eklenmi\u015Ftir. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n, soldaki k\xFCreler da\u011F\u0131l\u0131r
    ve sa\u011Fda arazi \xFCretilir.\n\n\u0130ki k\xFC\xE7\xFCk \xF6rnekle rastgeleli\u011Fi
    inceliyoruz. Soldaki \xF6rnekte k\xFCreleri bir dairenin i\xE7ine rastgele da\u011F\u0131t\u0131yor
    ve tohumun ayn\u0131 dizilimi nas\u0131l yeniden \xFCretti\u011Fini g\xF6r\xFCyoruz.
    Sa\u011Fdaki \xF6rnekte Perlin g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCs\xFCyle k\xFCplerden bir arazi
    \xFCretiyor, \xF6l\xE7e\u011Fin, y\xFCksekli\u011Fin ve tohumun araziyi nas\u0131l
    de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi\u011Fini izliyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders11_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Soldaki
    dairenin i\xE7ine 40 k\xFCre da\u011F\u0131l\u0131r. Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131p
    yeniden \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. K\xFCreler ayn\u0131 yerlerdedir."
  - "Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n. Dagitici nesnesini se\xE7in ve Tohum de\u011Ferini
    7 yap\u0131n. \xC7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. Dizilim de\u011Fi\u015Fir. Play
    modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n, Tohum Kullan kutusunun i\u015Faretini kald\u0131r\u0131n
    ve iki kez \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n. Dizilim her seferinde farkl\u0131d\u0131r."
  - "Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki GurultuArazi beti\u011Fini
    a\xE7\u0131n ve Guncelle fonksiyonunu okuyun. Perlin g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCs\xFCn\xFCn
    \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131 sat\u0131r\u0131 bulun."
  - "GurultuArazi beti\u011Fini Arazi nesnesine ekleyin ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n.
    900 k\xFCpten olu\u015Fan bir arazi \xFCretilir."
  - "Play modundayken Arazi nesnesinde Perlin Kullan kutusunun i\u015Faretini kald\u0131r\u0131n.
    Arazi sivri s\xFCtunlara d\xF6ner. Kutuyu yeniden i\u015Faretleyin."
  - "Olcek de\u011Ferini s\u0131ras\u0131yla 0.05, 0.3 ve 1 yap\u0131n. Tepeler \xF6nce
    geni\u015Fler, sonra s\u0131kla\u015F\u0131r, sonunda arazi d\xFCzle\u015Fir.
    De\u011Feri yeniden 0.12 yap\u0131n."
  - "Yukseklik de\u011Ferini 12 yap\u0131n ve Su Seviyesi s\xFCrg\xFCs\xFCn\xFC oynat\u0131n.
    De\u011Ferleri eski haline getirin."
  - "Tohum de\u011Ferini 1, 2 ve 3 yap\u0131n. Her tohum farkl\u0131 bir arazi verir.
    Yeniden 1 yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131zda ilk arazi geri gelir. Play modundan
    \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "Dagitici nesnesinde Adet de\u011Ferini 400 yap\u0131n. K\xFCreler dairenin i\xE7ine
    e\u015Fit da\u011F\u0131l\u0131yor mu?"
  - "GurultuArazi beti\u011Finde g\xFCr\xFClt\xFC sat\u0131r\u0131ndaki iki kaymadan
    birini silin. Arazi nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor?"
  - "Boyut de\u011Ferini 60 yap\u0131p Play modunu yeniden ba\u015Flat\u0131n. Arazi
    ka\xE7 k\xFCpten olu\u015Fuyor?"
  - "Su Seviyesi de\u011Ferini 0 ve 1 yap\u0131n. Her iki durumda arazi nas\u0131l
    g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor?"
